  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building of evaluation of China&apos;s health system reform pilots</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDO for this project is to strengthen the capacity of MoH on evaluating the pilots of current health system reform through supporting independent evaluation of the reform pilots as well as providing training on methodology of impact evaluation. The evaluation will test the effects of innovative interventions implemented in project counties on accessibility, costs, quality, equity and financial risk protection. The results of this evaluation will provide information and evidence to the government for the scaling up of the pilots throughout China and ultimately contribute to policies to strengthen overall health system reform in China.</narrative>
  </description>
